guide forever/horde/50-60/02-felwood
title Western Plaguelands, Azshara & Felwood
faction Horde
levels 52-54
zone Felwood
next forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 70-73) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Light's Hope Chapel -> fly to the Undercity -> ride east past the
# Bulwark: Felstone Farm -> Scarlet camp -> Dalson's Tears -> Mulgris
# Deepriver -> Sorrow Hill -> Andorhal (Chromie) -> Mulgris and his bears ->
# Tirion Fordring -> Kirsta Deepshadow and Hearthglen -> the Bulwark ->
# zeppelin to Orgrimmar, fly to Splintertree Post, ride north into Felwood:
# Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar -> Emerald Sanctuary and Deadwood Village ->
# Jaedenar -> Bloodvenom Post (flight path) and the Jadefire moonwell ->
# Shatter Scar Vale -> Irontree Woods -> Felpaw Village -> back south to the
# Emerald Sanctuary and Overlord Ror -> Bloodvenom Post -> Felpaw Village
# (grind to 54) -> through Timbermaw Hold to Everlook, where the next guide
# starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The two Western Plaguelands visits (70 and 73) are one loop, before
#   Felwood: Kirsta, Tirion, Marlene and Chromie are all on it. This drops
#   the export's hearth from Felwood to Light's Hope Chapel and its long trip
#   from the Plaguelands to Everlook; Felwood's north end leads straight into
#   Winterspring.
# - Western Plaguelands order: Sorrow Hill, Chromie and Mulgris' bears come
#   before Kirsta Deepshadow, so you have the level for her Hearthglen quest
#   (6025, red below 53) without grinding first. It adds about three minutes
#   of riding.
# - Scarlet Diversions, A Plague Upon Thee and the Bulwark's Scourgestones
#   were picked up in the previous guide; A Call to Arms (5094) was handed in
#   there.
# - Felwood: Jaedenar's cultists are cleared first so Greta's moonwell water
#   (5157) fits in the loop; Overlord Ror (6162) is killed on the ride back
#   south and Dreka'Sur's turn-in is on the final ride north.
# - Dropped: A Matter of Time and both Counting Out Time (4971-4973): Chromie
#   only offers them from level 53, and the loop reaches Andorhal just before
#   it. The old Timbermaw Ally and Deadwood of the North (6131, 6221) are
#   pre-1.11 copies of 8460 and 8461, which the game offers instead.
# - Optional: the Scourgestone turn-ins (5402, 5403, 5407, 5408: repeatable,
#   20 Minion's or 10 Invader's stones each, worn Argent Dawn Commission),
#   Feathers for Grazle and Nafien (8466, 8467: repeatable Timbermaw
#   turn-ins), Deadwood Ritual Totem (8470: a rare drop) and Arko'narin's
#   chain (5202, 5203, 5204, 5385), which starts from a Blood Red Key that
#   only drops now and then in Jaedenar.
# - Grind: level 54 at Felpaw Village before Winterspring, which makes up for
#   the dropped Chromie quests and raises Timbermaw reputation for the tunnel.
# - Grind: level 53 at the Northridge Lumber Camp before Kirsta's last task
#   (6025 needs 53).
# - Checked and not added: Counting Out Time (4972) needs A Matter of Time
#   (4971; Chromie, level 53), which the Silithus guide does when it passes
#   Andorhal at 58. Silver Heart (4084) needs Linken's Memory (3942), which
#   the route only accepts at 57. Guarding Secrets (4883) needs the
#   Blue-feathered Necklace quest (4882), which comes after Wild Guardians
#   (4741) at about 57. Target: Writhing Haunt and its return (5233, 5234)
#   need the Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears cauldrons first; the route
#   does those at 58.
# - Emerald Sanctuary, on the way back south: Taronn, Greta and Jessir, who
#   stand together, before Maybess Riverbreeze on the west side.
#
# Left open for later guides: Better Late Than Never (5023, Royal Overseer
# Bauhaus), Little Pamela (5142), Glyphed Oaken Branch (4987, Nara Wildmane),
# All Along the Watchtowers (5098), Target: Felstone Field (5229), A Plague
# Upon Thee (5902), Tirion's Demon Dogs, Blood Tinged Skies and Carrion
# Grubbage (5542-5544), Brother Carlin (5210), Seeking Spiritual Aid (5158,
# Islen Waterseer), Speak to Salfa (8465), Runecloth (6031), Wild Guardians
# (4521) and The Strength of Corruption (4120, Talo Thornhoof).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Western Plaguelands

step Fly to the Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip From Light's Hope Chapel's flight master, fly to the Undercity.
  fly "Undercity"

step Janice Felstone
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades, past the Bulwark. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house.
  accept 5021
  turnin 5021                         -- Janice's Parcel, beside the house
  accept 5023
  note Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity.

step Scarlet forward camp
  tip The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner.
  interact 176088
  complete 5096

step Sorrow Hill
  tip Argent Officer Pureheart stands at the south end of the Sorrow Hill graveyard, where the road from Tarren Mill comes in; Marlene's house stands by the road, and Joseph Redpath's monument is in the graveyard behind it.
  turnin 5152                         -- Marlene Redpath
  accept 5142
  accept 5153
  collect 12894 quest 5153 @49.7,76.8
  accept 5402 optional                -- Argent Officer Pureheart, at the graveyard's south end
  accept 5403 optional
  turnin 5402 optional
  turnin 5403 optional
  note Keep Little Pamela: Pamela is in Darrowshire, visited again later.

step Mulgris Deepriver
  tip He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears.
  accept 4984

step Chromie
  tip Ride north-west into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town; the skeletons inside are 54-57, so keep to the edges.
  turnin 5153
  accept 5154

step The Annals of Darrowshire
  tip The Annals lie among the Musty Tomes in Andorhal's town hall; open them until you find the right one.
  collect 12900 quest 5154 @43.4,69.5

step Chromie
  turnin 5154
  accept 5210
  note Brother Carlin goes to Light's Hope Chapel: keep it for later.

step Diseased Wolves
  tip The wolves roam the fields between Andorhal, Dalson's Tears and the Writhing Haunt. Finish them on the ride back east.
  tip At 52, take the level 53 wolves; leave the 54s alone.
  kill 1817 quest 4984

step Level 53
  when level<53
  tip Top up here to level 53 before Mulgris sends you after the Diseased Grizzlies (55-56): the Carrion Lurkers (52-53) on the way from Dalson's Tears to the Writhing Haunt are at your level. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon or the Blackrock Depths dungeon instead.
  goto 51.1,64.3 map 1422 "Carrion Lurker"
  level 53 grind 1821                  -- grind on Carrion Lurker

step Mulgris Deepriver
  turnin 4984
  accept 4985

step Diseased Grizzlies
  tip The bears roam the hills north and east of the Writhing Haunt.
  kill 1816 quest 4985

step Mulgris Deepriver
  turnin 4985
  accept 4987
  note Keep the branch: Nara Wildmane is in Thunder Bluff.

step Tirion Fordring
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride north along the eastern hills; Tirion lives in a small house by the Thondroril River, at the border with the Eastern Plaguelands.
  accept 5542
  accept 5543
  accept 5544
  note Tirion's hunts are in the Eastern Plaguelands: keep them for later.

step Augustus the Touched
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Cross the river east into Terrordale, the ruined town in the north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands. Augustus sits in a hut at its edge.
  accept 6164                         -- Inside

step Terrordale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale; the undead in the town are 54-56, so pull them one at a time.
  tip The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass.
  collect 15884 quest 6164 @17.4,31.1 -- Upstairs
  collect 15043 quest 5901
  collect 12840 quest 5408 optional   -- Minion's Scourgestones: the Terrordale undead drop them while you wear the Argent Dawn Commission
  note Keep Augustus' Receipt Book: Augustus takes it back on the Eastern Plaguelands guide's Terrordale stop.

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Ride back west over the river and on to the Northridge Lumber Camp; Kirsta hides on the hill north-east of it.
  accept 6004

step Scarlet Crusade
  tip Knights and magi work the Northridge Lumber Camp; the medics and hunters camp south of it.
  kill 10605 quest 6004.1
  kill 1831 quest 6004.2
  kill 1833 quest 6004.4
  kill 1826 quest 6004.3

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  turnin 6004
  accept 6023

step Radley and Durgen
  tip Huntsman Radley stands east of the lumber camp; Cavalier Durgen guards the road north-east of Kirsta, toward Hearthglen.
  kill 11613 quest 6023
  kill 11611 quest 6023

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  turnin 6023

step Northridge Lumber Camp
  tip Kirsta's last task needs level 53. The Scarlet Knights and Magi (54-55) working the lumber camp just south-west of her are the closest camp.
  level 53 grind 1833 -- grind on Scarlet Knights at Northridge Lumber Camp, Western Plaguelands

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  accept 6025

step Hearthglen
  tip Hearthglen's Scarlets are level 58-60. Ride in to the high point marked on your map, look over the town, and get out.
  complete 6025 @45.5,18.6

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  turnin 6025

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the Bulwark.
  turnin 5096                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 5098
  accept 5228
  turnin 5228                         -- Shadow Priestess Vandis
  accept 5229
  turnin 5407 optional                -- Argent Officer Garush
  turnin 5408 optional
  turnin 5901                         -- Mickey Levine
  accept 5902
  note Derrington's watchtowers, Vandis' cauldron and Mickey's barrel are done on a later visit: keep them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Felwood

step Fly to Valormok
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Azshara's camps are 46-53, right at your level now: fly over before Felwood.
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Valormok"
  zone Azshara

step Valormok
  accept 91488                        -- Kurll: Mosshoof hides on the way through Azshara
  accept 3517                         -- Jediga
  accept 3505                         -- Ag'tor Bloodfist
  accept 91568                        -- Izvi Gildfizz
  accept 91569                        -- Izvi Gildfizz: Blue Gold, a wand from the blood elves' arcanists

step Ruins of Eldarath: kill these as you meet them
  zone Azshara
  tip Ride east to the ruins on the coast. The four tablets lie among the ruins, guarded by Spitelash naga (46-52): pull them one at a time.
  collect 10540 quest 3517
  collect 10538 quest 3517
  collect 10541 quest 3517
  collect 10539 quest 3517

step Ruins of Eldarath
  when onquest 3568
  tip Ride east to the ruins on the coast. Fill Cuely's four vials at the tide pools along the shore; Spitelash naga patrol between them.
  goto 35.0,55.0 "Ruins of Eldarath"
  complete 3568

step Mosshoof hides
  tip Look for Mosshoof Runners, Stags and Coursers between Valormok and the coast. They drop the hides for Kurll.
  collect 238463 x5 quest 91488.1

step Makrinni Burrowers
  tip The Makrinni Burrowers (50-51) dig in the sands just east of the ruins, on the way north-east; they and the buried caches there give up the Highborne Treasure Fragments.
  collect 246684 quest 91568

step Ekkal
  tip On north-east across the middle of Azshara: Ekkal camps by the road.
  accept 86746                        -- Ekkal: The Legashi Threat, the satyrs north of the blood elves' camp

step Kim'jael
  tip Ride north-east to the goblin's camp on the cliffs above the Bay of Storms, just north of the blood elves.
  accept 3601

step Thalassian Base Camp
  tip The blood elves camp on the cliffs in the north-east, by the Bay of Storms. Kim'jael's four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp; the Blood Elf Arcanists carry Izvi's wand.
  tip Careful: a Blackmaw Thrall, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the west edge of the camp: work the blood elves from its east side.
  kill 6199 quest 3505.1
  kill 6198 quest 3505.2 @56.2,29.9
  collect 10717 quest 3601
  collect 10715 quest 3601
  collect 10718 quest 3601
  collect 10722 quest 3601
  collect 246680 quest 91569.1        -- Mana-Siphoning Wand, from the Blood Elf Arcanists

step Magus Rimtori's camp
  tip Rimtori's camp is at the east end of the base camp. Read the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning there: on Forever the Sin'dorei Tome beside it then asks for the seals of the camp's three officers.
  complete 3505 @59.53,31.47 map 1447 era
  turnin 3505                         -- Kaldorei Tome of Summoning
  accept 91497                        -- Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning: Seals of the Sin'dorei

step Seals of the Sin'dorei
  tip Each of the camp's three officers (53) carries a seal: Lieutenant Suncrest in the middle of the camp, Ranger Lydrea at its eastern end, and Magister Hawkhelm, who walks its western half: take him on the east side of his walk, where the arrow points.
  tip Careful: the Blackmaw Thrall, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the camp's western edge, close to the far end of Hawkhelm's walk: wait for Hawkhelm to come back east.
  collect 246725 quest 91497.1        -- Seal of the Warden, from Lieutenant Suncrest
  collect 246721 quest 91497.2        -- Seal of the Warrior, from Magister Hawkhelm
  collect 246722 quest 91497.3        -- Seal of the Ranger, from Ranger Lydrea

step The Legashi satyrs
  tip The Legashi satyrs (51-52) hold the hills north of the blood elves' camp: Ekkal wants five of each kind.
  kill 6200 quest 86746.1             -- Legashi Satyr
  kill 6201 quest 86746.2             -- Legashi Rogue
  kill 6202 quest 86746.3             -- Legashi Hellcaller

step Kim'jael
  tip Back north-west to Kim'jael.
  turnin 3601
  accept 5534

step Ruins of Eldarath: Some Rune
  tip Ride south to the northern edge of the Ruins of Eldarath. The Spitelash Sirens and Myrmidons (50-52) there carry Kim'jael's rune; it doesn't drop often, so work your way along the edge until it does.
  collect 13815 quest 5534.1 @47.5,44.5

step Kim'jael
  tip Back north to Kim'jael with the rune, then south-west along the road.
  turnin 5534

step Ekkal
  tip South-west along the road: Ekkal takes the satyrs.
  turnin 86746

step Valormok
  tip Ride back west to Valormok.
  turnin 91488                        -- Kurll
  turnin 3517                         -- Jediga
  accept 3518                         -- Magatha is at the next Thunder Bluff stop
  accept 92346                        -- Nara Wildmane is there too
  turnin 91568                        -- Izvi Gildfizz
  turnin 91569                        -- Izvi Gildfizz
  accept 3541
  accept 3542
  accept 3561
  note Keep the seals for the tome. Return after Winterspring for Magus Rimtori (55).

step Archmage Xylem
  tip Xylem's tower stands on the cliff just north of Valormok: Sanath Lim-yo, in Valormok, teleports you up for free (talk to him); otherwise the path winds up its north side.
  turnin 3561                         -- Upstairs
  accept 3565

step Jediga
  turnin 3565

step Fly back to Orgrimmar
  zone Azshara
  goto 22.0,49.7 "Valormok flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Jes'rimon
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 3541                         -- Jes'rimon, the Cleft of Shadow
  accept 3563                         -- Keep the payment for the return to Valormok

step Fly to Splintertree Post
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Splintertree Post"
  zone Ashenvale

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Felwood

step Felwood
  zone Felwood
  goto 50.9,81.6 "Emerald Sanctuary"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Emerald Sanctuary and Jaedenar

step Emerald Sanctuary
  zone Felwood
  tip The druids' camp is just past the border.
  accept 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  accept 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 4102                         -- Maybess Riverbreeze, just west of the camp

step Southern Jaedenar
  tip Follow the road north-west. The south of Jaedenar, around its corrupted moonwell, is held by Shadow Council cultists, adepts, guardsmen and their hounds.
  kill 7125 quest 5155.1
  kill 7115 quest 5155.3
  kill 7112 quest 5155.4
  kill 7113 quest 5155.2

step A Strange Red Key
  tip Only if a Blood Red Key dropped: use it to start the quest, then free Arko'narin in her cage in Shadow Hold, the cave at the north end of Jaedenar, and escort her out.
  accept 5202 optional
  turnin 5202 optional                -- Captured Arko'narin
  accept 5203 optional
  complete 5203 optional

step Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Ride back south-east to the Sanctuary.
  turnin 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5157
  turnin 5203 optional                -- Jessir Moonbow
  accept 5204 optional
  accept 8460                         -- Grazle, at the south edge of the camp

step Deadwood Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolg village lies just south of the Sanctuary. Every Deadwood kill also raises your Timbermaw Hold reputation; keep the headdress feathers.
  kill 7153 quest 8460.1
  kill 7155 quest 8460.2
  kill 7154 quest 8460.3

step Grazle
  turnin 8460
  accept 8462
  accept 8466 optional                -- Only with 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers
  turnin 8466 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North through Felwood

step The Jaedenar moonwell
  tip Back north to Jaedenar. Fill Greta's canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of the southern camp.
  collect 12907 quest 5157 @35.2,59.8

step Rakaiah
  tip Only if you rescued Arko'narin: the succubus Rakaiah waits in the middle of Jaedenar, beside the Remains of Trey Lightforge.
  kill 9518 quest 5204 optional
  turnin 5204 optional                -- Remains of Trey Lightforge
  accept 5385 optional

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip The Horde camp just north of Jaedenar.
  getfp "Bloodvenom Post"
  accept 6162                         -- Dreka'Sur
  accept 4505                         -- Winna Hazzard
  accept 4521                         -- Trull Failbane: the owlbeasts are in Winterspring

step Shatter Scar Vale
  tip East of Bloodvenom Post, the cratered vale where the Entropic Beasts and Horrors roam. Kill two of each, then walk to each of the three fel-water craters.
  goto 41.6,43.0 "Southern crater"
  goto 40.4,41.2 "Western crater"
  goto 42.2,40.3 "Northern crater"
  complete 5156
  kill 9878 quest 5156.1
  kill 9879 quest 5156.2

step Statue of Malorne
  tip The Statue of Malorne stands just south of the vale, by the road north: its bauble starts a quest for Winna Hazzard, handed in on the last ride north past Bloodvenom Post.
  accept 86612 object 661778 @42.0,47.3 -- Statue of Malorne

step Irontree Woods
  tip Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo, and their organs are Kelek's.
  kill 8957 quest 4120.1
  kill 8961 quest 4120.2
  collect 277958 quest 86577.1        -- Putrescent Bear Organs, from the Angerclaw bears
  collect 277959 quest 86577.2        -- Putrescent Wolf Organs, from the Felpaw wolves

step Irontree Woods
  collect 11503 quest 4102            -- Below ground

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back south

step The Jadefire moonwell
  tip On the return from Irontree, ride south past Jaedenar to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill Winna's flasket there.
  collect 12567 quest 4505 @32.3,66.6

step Overlord Ror
  tip Ror stands at the far south end of Deadwood Village.
  collect 15879 quest 6162 @48.2,94.3

step Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Stop at the Sanctuary on the ride north from Ror.
  turnin 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  turnin 5157                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5158
  turnin 4102                         -- Maybess Riverbreeze, on the west side of the Sanctuary
  turnin 86577                        -- Kelek Skykeeper
  note Keep Seeking Spiritual Aid: Islen Waterseer is in the Barrens.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North to Winterspring

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip Ride north up the road to Bloodvenom Post, on the way to the tunnel.
  turnin 6162                         -- Dreka'Sur
  turnin 86612                        -- Winna Hazzard: the Stag Lord's Bauble
  turnin 4505                         -- Winna Hazzard
  accept 4506

step Winna's kitten
  tip Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there with Winna's Kitten Carrier; once it has turned into a Corrupted Saber, bring it back to Winna and click on it to hand it over.
  use 12565 quest 4506.1 @32.3,66.6 map 1448 -- Winna's Kitten Carrier, at the Jadefire moonwell
  complete 4506

step Winna Hazzard
  turnin 4506

step Level 54
  when level<54
  tip On the ride north, finish any of Talo's grizzlies and ravagers still needed. Stay with the grizzlies (51-52) until 54 before Felpaw's level 55 Avengers. Or, with a group, run the Alcaz Prison dungeon or the Blackrock Depths dungeon instead.
  goto 51.3,15.4 map 1448 "Irontree Woods"
  kill 8957 quest 4120.1
  kill 8961 quest 4120.2
  level 54 grind 8957

step Nafien
  tip Follow the road north past Felpaw Village to Nafien at the tunnel entrance.
  turnin 8462
  accept 8461

step Felpaw Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolg village just west of the tunnel. Chieftain Bloodmaw (56) stands among them. Meilosh, a friendly furbolg, sits at the north end of the village.
  tip Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Deadwood Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%.
  tip Keep killing them until one drops a Deadwood Ritual Totem, about one kill in thirty, then right-click it: Kernda in Timbermaw Hold takes it once the Timbermaw are Neutral to you, now if they already are, or when the last guide passes the cave again at 59.
  accept 6031 optional                -- Meilosh: keep 30 Runecloth for him; he trades only at Neutral with the Timbermaw; below ground
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3
  collect 20741                       -- Deadwood Ritual Totem
  accept 8470

step Nafien
  turnin 8461
  accept 8465
  turnin 8467 direct optional
  note Keep Speak to Salfa for Winterspring.

step Timbermaw Hold
  tip Step into the cave: Kernda stands just inside.
  turnin 8470 optional                -- Kernda: the Timbermaw speak to you only from Neutral; walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
